meta {
  name: List Refresh Token Metadata
  type: http
  seq: 5
  tags: [
    admin-read
  ]
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/resource/API%20Refresh%20Token?fields=%5B%22name%22%2C%22user%22%2C%22client_id%22%2C%22family_id%22%2C%22expires_at%22%2C%22used_at%22%2C%22revoked_at%22%2C%22replaced_by%22%2C%22ip_address%22%2C%22user_agent%22%5D&limit_start=0&limit_page_length=20
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

docs {
  Rute REST v1 bawaan Frappe, bukan endpoint RPC kustom aplikasi. Sumber framework: frappe/api/v1.py (routing, izin dan operasi dokumen), frappe/api/__init__.py (envelope data). Syarat: base_url situs tanpa slash akhir; access_token JWT aktif dari Authentication milik pengguna System Manager. Izin DocType tetap diperiksa; token tidak memberikan hak tambahan. Error framework dapat berupa 401 AuthenticationError, 403 PermissionError, 404 DoesNotExistError, atau 417 ValidationError; bentuk exc_type/exception/_server_messages bukan envelope error kustom aplikasi. Contoh tersimpan sintetis, disanitasi, ilustratif, bukan hasil eksekusi; representasi dokumen dapat memuat field tambahan.

  Sumber schema/controller aplikasi: api/rest_api/doctype/api_refresh_token/api_refresh_token.json dan api_refresh_token.py. Sukses 200: data array metadata sesi; [] bila kosong. Proyeksi fields JSON di-URL-encode sengaja tidak meminta token_hash maupun token plaintext. Salin name nyata ke refresh_token_name. Record used/revoked tetap disimpan untuk deteksi replay; metadata bukan kredensial dan bukan cara merefresh token.
  Payload: tidak ada (GET); parameter hanya URL/query.
}

example {
  name: Ilustratif sintetis - List Refresh Token Metadata
  description: Respons sintetis disanitasi; bukan hasil request nyata
  request: {
    url: {{base_url}}/api/resource/API%20Refresh%20Token?fields=%5B%22name%22%2C%22user%22%2C%22client_id%22%2C%22family_id%22%2C%22expires_at%22%2C%22used_at%22%2C%22revoked_at%22%2C%22replaced_by%22%2C%22ip_address%22%2C%22user_agent%22%5D&limit_start=0&limit_page_length=20
    method: get
    mode: none
  }
  response: {
    status: {
      code: 200
    }
    body: {
      type: json
      content: '''
        {
          "data": [
            {
              "name": "illustrative-session-001",
              "user": "manager@example.invalid",
              "client_id": "bruno-demo",
              "family_id": "illustrative-family-001",
              "expires_at": "2026-11-30 12:00:00",
              "used_at": null,
              "revoked_at": null,
              "replaced_by": null,
              "ip_address": "192.0.2.10",
              "user_agent": "Bruno illustrative"
            }
          ]
        }
      '''
    }
  }
}
